# Upstream CLC-A corpora vendored byte-exact from varwof/capability.
# Source commit: 80e483f  (main, after the merge of jdieselny PR #11)
# Verified in CI by scripts/verify_vector_pins.py. Do not edit by hand;
# regenerate only by re-exporting the file from the pinned upstream commit.
# .gitattributes marks these files -text so no checkout converts their bytes.
#
# These two digests are also the ones the CLC conformance registry baseline
# quotes for clc-v1/vectors.json and clc-v1/property-cases.json, so a mismatch
# here means we are running a different corpus from the one recorded upstream.
#
# This directory also holds project-owned vectors (ccx-iicp-001.json,
# clc-d-crosswalk-vectors.json). Unlike vectors/clc-v1 and vectors/clc-d, the
# checker verifies only the files listed below here; it does not require every
# *.json in this directory to be pinned.
3c1a5672d6f107444903f06c51a71ce92451f1b45ca92c5a84a345b0de5a5bbd  clc-a-core-vectors.json
f00ed1f49299293ac9fff1e10287b9642aa49d6dacf25b2b4a1be2d7103b2f07  property-cases.json
